OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after serious
OL,4,Acrash shuts A5
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the A5 between is closed
OL,7,Fin both directions after a serious
OL,8,Fcrash in Warwickshire, National
OL,9,FHighways said.
OL,11,FThe major route is shut between the
OL,12,FA428 turning for Crick,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, and the A426 junction
OL,14,Ffor Shawell, Leicestershire, after the
OL,15,Fcollision.
OL,17,FThe crash involved a car and a lorry
OL,18,Fand occurred at 08:49 BST at the
OL,19,Fjunction with Newton Lane near Rugby,
OL,20,FWarwickshire Police said.
