OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after serious
OL,4,Acrash shuts A5
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,7,Fthe driver of the car, a man, was found
OL,8,Fin a serious condition and taken to
OL,9,Fhospital. The lorry driver was
OL,10,Fdischarged at the scene.
